<title>HONG KONG: Hutch unit Hongville seen seeking loan.</title>
<headline>Hutch unit Hongville seen seeking loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongville Ltd, a wholly-held property-owning unit of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd, is seeking a three-year HK$2.83 billion term loan facility, bankers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The loan reportedly is guaranteed by Hutchison Whampoa.</p>
<p>Proceeds of the loan are expected to be used to refinance existing debt.</p>
<p>Bankers said CEF Capital is arranging the deal, but the company could not be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
